---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Resume · Josh Rutz" description="My leadership profile, and a PDF if you need the facts fast.">
  <header class="hero"><div class="wrap">
    <div class="eyebrow reveal">Resume</div>
    <h1 class="reveal">A team builder at heart. Technical to the core.</h1>
    <p class="lede reveal">Fifteen years across six studios, individual contributor to founder. The full
      profile reads the way I'd actually tell it. The PDF has the facts if you need them fast.</p>
    <div class="cta reveal">
      <a class="btn accent" href="/resume/profile.html">Read the full profile</a>
      <a class="btn ghost" href="/Josh-Rutz-Resume.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Download PDF</a>
    </div>
  </div></header>

  <section><div class="wrap">
    <div class="label reveal">In short<span class="rule"></span></div>
    <p class="body reveal">I get handed a team, or a gap where a lead should be, and I turn it into
      something that ships. I grow engineers in place, lead from inside the code, and build the systems
      that let a team move without waiting on me. Most recently I founded a studio and built its entire
      production system solo, the surface a team plugs into.</p>
  </div></section>
</Base>
